{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations","id":914510,"title":"What niches haven't been covered by canon organizations?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-14T18:06:40-07:00","id":914510,"title":"What niches haven't been covered by canon organizations?","content":"I was rereading an earlier Open Development blog post, and the question about what kind of group hadn't been done yet. Obviously this is one of the subforums that's most active with fan-made content, but I still think this might be a fun topic and one that may well spawn some awesome new ideas. To reiterate: what general ideas (whether from an untapped culture, focused on a different threat, organized differently from the existing ones, methodologically unique, or with a different type of Endowment) do you feel Hunter as a gameline is missing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T18:30:37-07:00","id":914521,"title":"","content":"There's not a lot of official material regarding effective 'ghost busters.' Keeping in mind that it's something any mortal can do, has purported representatives in real life, it's surprising that there's no compact or conspiracy dedicated to putting down ghosts or cleaning haunted houses. I know some fans have used Orpheus for this, and obviously there's the Sin-Eater game but it seems like a gap in Hunter.<br /> <br /> In the same vein, most of the hunter compacts and conspiracies do involve focusing on the other game-lines, and not much with the other things that dwell in the shadows. The Illuminated Brotherhood are focused on spirits, but no one seems to pay mind to claimed, hosts, strix, ghosts, Pandorans, hobgoblins and so forth. There's even a Demon-hunting conspiracy but no angel-hunting one.<br /> <br /> It would be nice to see a territorial mastermind-type conspiracy. An Illuminati of sorts. Some of the conspiracies get close but none really fit. It's a strange thing to miss, since there's so many organizations and entities trying to enforce the Masquerade from the monster side, that there's so few from the human side.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 06-14-2016, 09:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T18:50:07-07:00","id":914547,"title":"","content":"I'd really love to see a Conspiracy born from organized crime; the Night Watch is more like a street gang than something on the scale I'm considering. What happens when the yakuza or vory get tired of vampires and cultists moving in on their turf? These are groups with a lot of power in the shadows, often on an international scale... surely they bump up against real monsters and don't like being forced to share.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T18:57:25-07:00","id":914554,"title":"","content":"Seconding the &quot;illuminati&quot; and &quot;organized crime&quot; ideas, both are great. <br /> <br /> RE Ghostbusting, I believe there's actually a blue book supplement about ghosts and ghost hunters coming out this year? That'd be interesting to look at. I've seen some great ghost-focused orgs, the best being a Russian organization that used metals harvested from the underworld or something (can't remember the name, but they were posted here).<br /> <br /> Other things:<br /> <br /> - Beast hunters. We don't have any Beast-specific hunters for obvious reasons. I'd expect to see at least nods towards this in either Conquering Heroes or Hunter 2e. <br /> <br /> - Mad scientist-hunters. I think this is a great niche, since it covers a lot of potential targets. Prometheans, alchemists, Deviants, Geniuses, GM cultists...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T19:03:53-07:00","id":914560,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=914554#post914554\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beast hunters. We don't have any Beast-specific hunters for obvious reasons. I'd expect to see at least nods towards this in either Conquering Heroes or Hunter</div> </div> </div> </div>You realize we're not only getting this, but that all three groups have been posted as Open Decelopment here on the forums by the writer, right? <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar70_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"70\" data-vbnamecard=\"70\">MachineIV</a> has done some great work with The Merrick Institute, The Reckoning, and Yuri's Group.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T19:11:56-07:00","id":914569,"title":"","content":"Oh, shit, I saw those threads and assumed they were homebrew, my bad.<br /> <br /> EDIT: You came up with a good idea in the other thread, a compact or conspiracy based out of the CDC or FEMA that deals with supernatural diseases.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 06-14-2016, 11:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T00:05:05-07:00","id":914704,"title":"","content":"Considering how many little Masquerades the setting has, the mass-media must be a hurricane of activity. So far it's an unexplored niche.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T00:45:28-07:00","id":914710,"title":"","content":"Yay! All of my indexing is finally useful!<br /> <br /> -Promethean/Fae/Ghost hunters. We have hunters of all other kinds, and I understand that things like Prometheans are quit rare, but still covering all the main gamelines would just relieve that itch I have.<br /> <br /> -Russian/Indian/Chinese/South American/Australian/Sub Sahara African groups. Those places are big, and yet they lack their own groups. While others countries also lack organizations (Israeli, Mexican or Spanish organizations could be cool), but I want to at least feel that the Vigil is world wide, meaning that all the &quot;big regions&quot; should be touched, at least.<br /> <br /> -other religious organizations. While we do have a number of those, they are either Christian, Muslim or some fictional religion (Faithful of Shulpae), which is good, but I want to see more of those as part of the &quot;world wide Vigil&quot; thing I want to feel. Hindu, Buddhist and/or Jewish groups would be interesting to see, I think.<br /> <br /> other than that- a some sort of &quot;detective agency&quot; could be fun to have, a more of a private organization than a Federal Agency like VASCU. While the Ascending Ones kinda touch the &quot;underworld hunters&quot;, a full blown criminal organization could be fun to have. An hunter support group, which focus on patching other hunters up, or groups which focus at hunting the &quot;deeper evil&quot; (strix, idigam, angels, etc) may also be nice to see, I think.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T00:49:42-07:00","id":914712,"title":"","content":"A diplomatic group would be stellar. I'd honestly be happy with the Lord Stewards being made canon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T06:30:11-07:00","id":914789,"title":"","content":"Oh, the Lord Stewards were amazing. One of my favorite homebrew groups.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T07:18:28-07:00","id":914811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=914712#post914712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A diplomatic group would be stellar. I'd honestly be happy with the Lord Stewards being made canon.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Ascending Ones actually talk about doing this, though one can be forgiven for missing it in the hodge podge of stuff they've got rattling around. I'd like to see this aspect of their Vigil given greater emphasis in the future, if only to differentiate them a little more from the other Conspiracies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T07:22:50-07:00","id":914815,"title":"","content":"May have missed it, but I don't remember any Hunter group that's specifically on the lookout for those that eat or otherwise destroy souls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/158192-what-s-your-custom-legacy?p=1109906#post1109906\" target=\"_blank\">My custom legacy</a> (2e)- The Disciples of Rathma - Life/Death focused Moros/Thyrsus Legacy, comments appreciated","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/166-joker","name":"Joker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T08:44:02-07:00","id":914853,"title":"","content":"Perhaps a bit recursive, and with minor overlap with VASCU, but what about a Hunter Conspiracy that hunts other Hunters that step out of line (depending on what the &quot;line&quot; is)? Who Watches The Watchmen, basically.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T10:05:38-07:00","id":914891,"title":"","content":"I like that, especially since there's so much room in the setting for both morally dubious-to-evil hunters (Ashwood, Cheiron, the Hunt Club, technically any group on a bad day) and supernatural menaces who started as hunters (Slashers, Heroes, probably some Deviants). There's a Hero-hunting Compact in open dev from David A. Hill, but that's very specifically Beast-focused, since their entire methodology and ideology revolves around Beasts and Heroes. I'd say that your idea would work great as its own thing, with Heroes being one of their regular targets. <br /> <br /> I'm leaning more towards Compact, though, since I can't think of anything that would make a good Endowment for them. Maybe they're even made up of members of other Compacts and Conspiracies?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T10:53:08-07:00","id":914914,"title":"","content":"I'd like to see a group that's goal is to enforce the supernatural status quo. They recognize that the world is populated by a great number of supernatural beings, all of which they think belong. They like the world as it is though and don't want to see Vampire's ghouling the President, Demons actually detroying the God Machine, Mages mass revealing the lie, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9065-darkblade","name":"Darkblade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T11:53:04-07:00","id":914954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=914547#post914547\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd really love to see a Conspiracy born from organized crime; the Night Watch is more like a street gang than something on the scale I'm considering. What happens when the yakuza or vory get tired of vampires and cultists moving in on their turf? These are groups with a lot of power in the shadows, often on an international scale... surely they bump up against real monsters and don't like being forced to share.</div> </div> </div> </div>I did a write up for a compact based on the US mob, unless you're talking about wanting an official compact?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T12:03:32-07:00","id":914963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Geckopirateship</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=914891#post914891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like that, especially since there's so much room in the setting for both morally dubious-to-evil hunters (Ashwood, Cheiron, the Hunt Club, technically any group on a bad day) and supernatural menaces who started as hunters (Slashers, Heroes, probably some Deviants). There's a Hero-hunting Compact in open dev from David A. Hill, but that's very specifically Beast-focused, since their entire methodology and ideology revolves around Beasts and Heroes. I'd say that your idea would work great as its own thing, with Heroes being one of their regular targets.<br /> <br /> I'm leaning more towards Compact, though, since I can't think of anything that would make a good Endowment for them. Maybe they're even made up of members of other Compacts and Conspiracies?</div> </div> </div> </div>I mostly said/meant Conspiracy for the organizational scale. I don't really care about tying Endowments to Tier (seeing as some Compacts really deserve an Endowment, while some Conspiracies are only such due to them possessing one).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T14:41:29-07:00","id":915095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=914853#post914853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perhaps a bit recursive, and with minor overlap with VASCU, but what about a Hunter Conspiracy that hunts other Hunters that step out of line (depending on what the &quot;line&quot; is)? Who Watches The Watchmen, basically.</div> </div> </div> </div>actually, I've tried that line of thought twice for homebrew groups, and on both times it didn't ended in a nice way- one is crazy mind raping agents of a [redacted] organization, while the other, well, is the Spanish Inquisition (although one of the Los Inocentes's modern options is quit nice)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T14:49:11-07:00","id":915102,"title":"","content":"I'm constantly reminded of the overlap with werewolf. It would be a shame if there wasn't mention of some sort of connection.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T21:42:34-07:00","id":915388,"title":"","content":"Crossposted ramblings for my blog<br /> <br /> -Benevolent conspiracy within the CDC that's primarily focused with containment of large-scale/infectious supernatural threats. One coven of witches or a lone vampire really aren't a big enough deal for them to worry about because they only impact their immediate surroundings, while a zombie virus or epidemic of possessions could possibly topple the entire nation. Prone to compromising with isolated unnatural creatures for the greater good; &quot;We won't tell the guys with guns about you if you help us quarantine this,&quot; or &quot;If this kills everyone in Chicago, you won't have anyone to prey on and you'll fucking starve.&quot; <br /> <br /> -Group focused on combating Claimed and Hosts, but one with no knowledge of spirits or the Father Wolf myth; most likely view them as psychic alien parasites. Possible deranged &quot;are we the baddies?&quot; vibe to them (a la the Army of the Third Eye, performing nonconsensual trepanation in order to save the world since the 1990s) bordering on a hunted domestic terror group.<br /> <br /> -Remnant of a Soviet program that vanished during the regime change, calling upon the well-documented ties between the Russian intelligence apparatus and the Russian criminal underworld. Grizzled old spies performing dubious science with scavenged parts on tough-as-nails tattooed vory to turn them into psychics. Do they fight evil or just exploit the supernatural to make them even richer?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T21:55:12-07:00","id":915398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=915388#post915388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Crossposted ramblings for my blog<br /> <br /> -Benevolent conspiracy within the CDC that's primarily focused with containment of large-scale/infectious supernatural threats. One coven of witches or a lone vampire really aren't a big enough deal for them to worry about because they only impact their immediate surroundings, while a zombie virus or epidemic of possessions could possibly topple the entire nation. Prone to compromising with isolated unnatural creatures for the greater good; &quot;We won't tell the guys with guns about you if you help us quarantine this,&quot; or &quot;If this kills everyone in Chicago, you won't have anyone to prey on and you'll fucking starve.&quot; <br /> <br /> -Group focused on combating Claimed and Hosts, but one with no knowledge of spirits or the Father Wolf myth; most likely view them as psychic alien parasites. Possible deranged &quot;are we the baddies?&quot; vibe to them (a la the Army of the Third Eye, performing nonconsensual trepanation in order to save the world since the 1990s) bordering on a hunted domestic terror group.<br /> <br /> -Remnant of a Soviet program that vanished during the regime change, calling upon the well-documented ties between the Russian intelligence apparatus and the Russian criminal underworld. Grizzled old spies performing dubious science with scavenged parts on tough-as-nails tattooed vory to turn them into psychics. Do they fight evil or just exploit the supernatural to make them even richer?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmmm, Compact, Compact, Conspiracy?<br /> <br /> Going over my various homebrew ideas, I think with a little alteration I could easily make the existing Mage-hunters into enemies of the Enlightened. Maybe a group of some sort based on fighting &quot;reality destabilization&quot;? I feel like Network Zero and Null Mysteriis would have some great/horrific interactions with them.<br /> <br /> About the CDC one, how about The Hooke Initiative as a possible name? And for their three branches, maybe Pathologists, Responders, and Lobbyists? And they could also have a small group of researchers studying memetic viruses and cognitohazards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5358,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","user":"Geckopirateship","date":". 06-16-2016, 06:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-16T09:59:00-07:00","id":915674,"title":"","content":"A group with a focus on more &quot;minor&quot; supernaturals might be interesting, and it wouldn't necessarily have to be hostile; a group designed to support playing, say, Wolfblooded or Stigmatic Hunters (or even one with just a few dots in a supernatural merit) might be interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3514,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","user":"ZealousChristian24","date":". 06-16-2016, 01:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T12:35:08-07:00","id":919266,"title":"","content":"I'd like to see a Compact or Conspiracy that focuses on 'managing' the Supernatural. Or, hell, just some groups that employ <i>iffy</i> methods, like trying to breed a captive group of Wolfblooded.<br /> <br /> ...<br /> <br /> Yes, I want the Bene Gesserit, why do you ask?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T16:37:17-07:00","id":919370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=915388#post915388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-Remnant of a Soviet program that vanished during the regime change, calling upon the well-documented ties between the Russian intelligence apparatus and the Russian criminal underworld. Grizzled old spies performing dubious science with scavenged parts on tough-as-nails tattooed vory to turn them into psychics. Do they fight evil or just exploit the supernatural to make them even richer?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a bit late for that. I mean, the Soviet collapse was a long time ago and I gather the vory are kinda a dying breed these days. Actually, that last one might not be a problem for a hunter group.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T16:41:04-07:00","id":919373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=919370#post919370\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a bit late for that. I mean, the Soviet collapse was a long time ago and I gather the vory are kinda a dying breed these days. Actually, that last one might not be a problem for a hunter group.</div> </div> </div> </div>That just makes for interesting writing: a Conspiracy struggling to recruit new members.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-23T06:22:05-07:00","id":919671,"title":"","content":"A Conspiracy focused in capturing, experimenting and breeding cryptids, maybe for military purposes? I'm thinking in Weyland-Yutani or InGen with less of an idiot ball.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2411,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","user":"Raistlin","date":". 06-23-2016, 09:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-23T07:25:51-07:00","id":919699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raistlin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=919671#post919671\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Conspiracy focused in capturing, experimenting and breeding cryptids, maybe for military purposes? I'm thinking in Weyland-Yutani or InGen with less of an idiot ball.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awww, but that's where the fun is!<br /> <br /> More seriously, What would be their method of control? Tech, Occult, or Conditioning?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-23T09:17:01-07:00","id":919759,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=919699#post919699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Awww, but that's where the fun is!<br /> <br /> More seriously, What would be their method of control? Tech, Occult, or Conditioning?</div> </div> </div> </div>If there is something I learned from the franchises is that besties like Xenomorphs or Velociraptors <i><b>cannot </b></i>be conditioned. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-23T16:22:50-07:00","id":919994,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=919266#post919266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd like to see a Compact or Conspiracy that focuses on 'managing' the Supernatural. Or, hell, just some groups that employ <i>iffy</i> methods, like trying to breed a captive group of Wolfblooded.</div> </div> </div> </div>I always play Valkyrie more like this and less like idiot ball holding jackbooted thugs with laser cannons. They seek to control the supernatural, more than to destroy it. They leak intel to Iron Master packs who might hunt enemies of the United States military, they sell captured Lost back to their Keepers for future occult favors on terms negotiated by the finest legal minds in the world, they take the funding from Invictus while running more covert ops against them with plausible deniablity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9065-darkblade","name":"Darkblade","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-23T22:43:47-07:00","id":920183,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=915388#post915388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Crossposted ramblings for my blog<br /> <br /> -Remnant of a Soviet program that vanished during the regime change, calling upon the well-documented ties between the Russian intelligence apparatus and the Russian criminal underworld. Grizzled old spies performing dubious science with scavenged parts on tough-as-nails tattooed vory to turn them into psychics. Do they fight evil or just exploit the supernatural to make them even richer?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have always found Russia fascinating, and have played around with a similar ideas in my game. I have the idea seed for a conspiracy, but it needs more development.<br /> <br /> <i>The project began in 1984 in the Soviet Union, in the republic of Kazakstan. The project was called \u201cKholodnaya Voda, which translates to \u201cCold Water\u201d. On official records, the project was dedicated to advancing cryogenic science for the state. Unofficially, they were conducted to explore (and control) the boundary between life and death. The subjects were all considered \u201cexpendables\u201d; convicts, mental patients, political and religious dissidents. The project yielded only a handful of successes before being terminated in 1991.</i><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-23T22:50:37-07:00","id":920187,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reighnhell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=920183#post920183\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have always found Russia fascinating, and have played around with a similar ideas in my game. I have the idea seed for a conspiracy, but it needs more development.<br /> <br /> <i>The project began in 1984 in the Soviet Union, in the republic of Kazakstan. The project was called \u201cKholodnaya Voda, which translates to \u201cCold Water\u201d. On official records, the project was dedicated to advancing cryogenic science for the state. Unofficially, they were conducted to explore (and control) the boundary between life and death. The subjects were all considered \u201cexpendables\u201d; convicts, mental patients, political and religious dissidents. The project yielded only a handful of successes before being terminated in 1991.</i><br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Funnily enough, that's basically how the Orpheus Group in oWoD got its start; subjecting death row inmates to forced near-death experiences in order to induce astral projection into the realm of gods.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T06:42:11-07:00","id":920331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darkblade</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=919994#post919994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I always play Valkyrie more like this and less like idiot ball holding jackbooted thugs with laser cannons. They seek to control the supernatural, more than to destroy it. They leak intel to Iron Master packs who might hunt enemies of the United States military, they sell captured Lost back to their Keepers for future occult favors on terms negotiated by the finest legal minds in the world, they take the funding from Invictus while running more covert ops against them with plausible deniablity.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's pretty much how I run TF:V as well. With regards to Changeling though Mortal Remains actually paints an interesting picture. Changelings frequently come back to find their lives have been stolen, along with any legal documentation that they're a person. When TF:V runs across them what they prefer to do if they aren't an immediate danger to the public is give them a shiny new legal identity and use them as informants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T21:09:59-07:00","id":927436,"title":"","content":"To expand on an earlier idea, a CDC/FEMA joint task force focused on quarantine of the supernatural might be fun. They don't have the funds, staff, or zeal to go out and drag every vampire out into the sunlight, but when there's an outbreak of fast zombies in Phoenix or an entire town in Tennesee becomes a hive-mind, they're the ones who make sure nobody gets in or out, the media stays looking elsewhere, and they can take the live samples back to the lab while they burn everything else to the ground. <br /> <br /> Possible faction divide between the Scorched Earth guys and the humane idealists who want to cure all the afflicted. Constant strife with Network Zero (who want to blow all of their operations) and VALKYRIE (who want to nuke the problem rather than learn anything from it). Primary operations in mainland USA, but can be found anywhere plausible American humanitarian aid could be. Stress that these guys are not armed badasses, they're scientists, medics, and spin doctors.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T04:37:03-07:00","id":927546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=919370#post919370\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a bit late for that. I mean, the Soviet collapse was a long time ago and I gather the vory are kinda a dying breed these days. Actually, that last one might not be a problem for a hunter group.</div> </div> </div> </div>Replace communists with nazis and you have the Loyalists of Thule.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T11:22:18-07:00","id":927699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beriorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=927546#post927546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Replace communists with nazis and you have the Loyalists of Thule.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really. The LoT have actually moved on. There's only really the three old men who are former Thulists. It'd be comparable if the LoT were all ODESSA members or something like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T16:53:38-07:00","id":927837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=927699#post927699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not really. The LoT have actually moved on. There's only really the three old men who are former Thulists. It'd be comparable if the LoT were all ODESSA members or something like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for reminding me how much I want a 1960s Loyalists of Thule chronicle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-08T21:49:54-07:00","id":928588,"title":"","content":"How about a group of comedians and pranksters that worship various trickster deities, particularly Coyote and Rabbit. They don't so much hunt the supernatural as much as they humiliate them and cause their evil plans to blow up in amusing ways. Their endowment ( a blessing from their trickster gods) allows them to warp reality in ways that follow cartoon logic (think that episode of south park where cartman went all Bug Bunny on Bin Laden, but replace bin laden with an elder vampire or whatever). I'm thinking of calling them the ACME Foundation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-08T22:55:59-07:00","id":928608,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=928588#post928588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about a group of comedians and pranksters that worship various trickster deities, particularly Coyote and Rabbit. They don't so much hunt the supernatural as much as they humiliate them and cause their evil plans to blow up in amusing ways. Their endowment ( a blessing from their trickster gods) allows them to warp reality in ways that follow cartoon logic (think that episode of south park where cartman went all Bug Bunny on Bin Laden, but replace bin laden with an elder vampire or whatever). I'm thinking of calling them the ACME Foundation.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sure there exists a playgroup for that, and I'd rather die than speak to any of them. Hunter is a horror game!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-09T02:32:55-07:00","id":928657,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/914510-what-niches-haven-t-been-covered-by-canon-organizations?p=928608#post928608\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sure there exists a playgroup for that, and I'd rather die than speak to any of them. Hunter is a horror game!</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on the type of witch you're up against.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-09T14:26:48-07:00","id":928906,"title":"","content":"1. A group of &quot;redeemed&quot; monsters who have somehow been &quot;cured&quot; of their existence and restored to humanity. The process is grueling, and affects their memories of their time among the damned (or whatever) and the specifics involved in their &quot;cure&quot;. Despite this, most are unwilling to return to their original state- which is why they are willing to work for the organization and bring in more subjects to be cured. Cause whatever the process is, it is temporary and requires &quot;upkeep&quot; every few months. In other words, the organization can effectively demand whatever they want if the beneficiaries of their treatment expect to retain this new found humanity.<br /> <br /> 2. Taking a page from Steven King's It, a conspiracy utilizing children, who when properly trained are uniquely effective at identifying and combating some forms of monster. <br /> <br /> 3. A group based in the far eastern philosophy, taking elements from some forms of Buddihism and Hinduism. In short, a group that believes in karma and the necessity of a turning wheel of life, death, and rebirth....and by extension hunts those things that can be said to &quot;linger&quot; in one incarnation past their natural lifespan. Vampires, ghosts, sin-eaters, mummies, some types of mages....all must be returned to the cycle if the suffering of this world is to be reduced. <br /> <br /> 4. A group of &quot;projectors&quot; that hunt in dreams and Twilight, taking the fight to the ephermeral, driving off things that stalk nightmares, and stalking physical entities from the safety of the unseen realm or deep within their subconscious minds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-09T15:48:00-07:00","id":928922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> 